{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "edb32ac0c96bf60f844c4cf938804a1faddf7fdfa7f4d3d15704893eda47b4ce", "ja": "わくわくショッピングタイム☆", "zh": "兴奋的购物时间☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "3a55b4b82b85aac8f584553b3e4f03bf58c1332f2ea7a311f0947017512b9946", "ja": "伊織の提案で、ショッピングモールにやって\nきた一同。春香も合流し、みんなでワイワイ\nと旅支度を整える。準備は万端、明日からの\nレッスンも頑張ろう、と気合いを入れるプロ\nデューサー。", "zh": "在伊织的提议下，大家来到了购物中心。\n春香也加入进来，大家热热闹闹地准备着\n旅行用品。准备万全后，制作人鼓起干劲，\n决定从明天开始也要好好努力上课。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d48b92279dacdc43c48f1cb20c7f32bdb198b9acb0813612a3bd6754c016e672", "ja": "（伊織の提案で、ショッピングモールへとやってきた。\n近くで仕事があった春香も、合流できた）", "zh": "（在伊织的提议下，我们来到了购物中心。正好在附近工作的春香也和我们会合了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_02_1001_032emi", "source_sha256": "32c9d3e0f64a0022003cbb272afd3835baa62791dcc18c1459f286a92c127403", "ja": "旅行の準備……といっても、私は\n着替えくらいしか自分では用意したことがなく……。", "zh": "说是准备旅行……可我自己也只准备过换洗衣物之类的……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_02_1002_022ser", "source_sha256": "4a4f816f6254157313251d2439fae30782cb23e79613a7aca11e307f237ff979", "ja": "わたしも、着替えだけです。\n他のものは、ママが用意をしてくれるので……。", "zh": "我也只准备换洗衣物。\n其他东西都是妈妈帮我准备的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_02_1003_001har", "source_sha256": "79d3d553af96b125c77e5b1bd149ec0393dbb7e24cc6b6997cc06654aa2e44e8", "ja": "私も、すぐには思い浮かばないけど……\nとりあえず、みんなでお店に入ってみようか？", "zh": "我也没能马上想到……不过，先一起进店里看看吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_02_1004_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_02_1005_p", "source_sha256": "07317ab5e0130f36ae1be9f23f55605d2811b58c8d0e651f7e1b33a6de113656", "ja": "よし、みんな揃ってるな。\nどうだ、いい買い物はできたか？", "zh": "好，大家都到齐了呢。\n怎么样，买到合心意的东西了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_02_1006_032emi", "source_sha256": "cd7d6c89a6acded6c4be7777fd56361217207382a1f28aac6f424b986f9cc97c", "ja": "はいっ！　私はまず、こちら……\n伊織さまにおすすめいただいた、小型の魔法瓶です！", "zh": "好的！我首先买了这个……\n这是伊织大人推荐的小型保温瓶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_02_1007_001har", "source_sha256": "afa89d425ea3f305f6c427409ebe11c9a329d82f7e58eaf66de4869e4e2789f7", "ja": "わぁ、こんな小さい魔法瓶があるんだね！\nお花柄でかわいい♪", "zh": "哇，原来还有这么小的保温瓶呀！\n花朵图案好可爱♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_02_1008_007ior", "source_sha256": "201b1438a62ee0f6cf8dd9a2b5f548fb3280f550fe058110ee4b6c7e4af2b64b", "ja": "これ、すごくいいのよ。\n小さくて軽いし、中身の温度が変わらないの。", "zh": "这个特别好用呢。\n又小又轻，而且里面装的东西能一直保持原来的温度。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_02_1009_022ser", "source_sha256": "79c2b263885e8f7b87469cadc831b6d211e3c5a1766eaced7738c97d7d5c84bd", "ja": "わたしも、同じものを買いました！\nエミリーちゃんと、色違いなんですよ。", "zh": "我也买了同款！\n和艾米莉是不同颜色的哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_02_1010_p", "source_sha256": "3ecd2ff0fbab25e75f627072c0fb5f779c1d714d449cf8590db9b7b3a9e060d2", "ja": "長時間の移動は、喉が渇くもんな。\nけど伊織が水筒なんて庶民的なもの、よく知ってたな。", "zh": "长时间赶路，嗓子会渴嘛。不过，伊织居然知道水壶这种平民化的东西啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_02_1011_007ior", "source_sha256": "5f77b71749815d2110ee43da388d67cb04dbc1c27e64c111d9f531159f43b787", "ja": "前に、雪歩に教えてもらったの。\n旅先って、普段とは違う環境でしょ？", "zh": "这是之前雪步教我的。\n旅行时会处在和平时不同的环境中，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_02_1012_007ior", "source_sha256": "8ccaa0496d3fcec13dcec0cc1feefc841c9a281f366f307ecb0d3aea86027a35", "ja": "だからいつも飲んでいるお茶や、\nお気に入りのお茶があると、落ち着くんですって。", "zh": "所以她说，只要有平时常喝的茶，或者自己喜欢的茶，就能安心下来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_02_1013_007ior", "source_sha256": "a084a2ff509035425f91b9df180206c8affbceddc1becedc78f98d625f4785da", "ja": "私は、いつも飲んでいる紅茶を入れているわ。\n新堂に頼んで、ティーバッグにしてもらってるの♪", "zh": "我泡的是平时一直在喝的红茶。还拜托新堂帮我做成了茶包呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_02_1014_p", "source_sha256": "3ea75e345dd8df03d4030db89313c77d1d205a5eefbb3b730f0853d868864dfd", "ja": "なるほど……雪歩らしいアドバイスだな。", "zh": "原来如此……真是雪步风格的建议啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_02_1015_001har", "source_sha256": "3974b71b973dcb1415f1f14feda98bdd6c02a8fc2556b4d9da164f54a138df75", "ja": "旅行先でもおいしい紅茶が飲めるって、ステキだね♪\nところで、伊織は何を買ってきたの？　……本？", "zh": "即使去旅行，也能喝到好喝的红茶，真不错呢♪\n话说回来，伊织买了什么回来？……书？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_02_1016_007ior", "source_sha256": "224398d421d2a2a5eccc741870cfc4d42ec2fbd304fec9db715aab6891c538f3", "ja": "ええ、そうよ。\n私はこのガイドブックを買ったわ！", "zh": "是啊。\n我买了这本指南！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_02_1017_p", "source_sha256": "c880673204cd3e9b27d15b891ceffd6fe12e002f1539e03a8c18ee574ff3c9b1", "ja": "『仙台グルメ100選』……\nなんだかすごく心を惹かれるタイトルだな。", "zh": "《仙台美食100选》……\n总觉得这个标题特别吸引人啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_02_1018_007ior", "source_sha256": "ff469999302b64d0261031aabe490361645a98a59f591b35489fa76096d9ec6c", "ja": "私の行きつけのお店もあるけど、\nどうせなら、新規開拓してみたいじゃない♪", "zh": "虽然也有我常去的店，但难得有机会，不如去开发新店嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_02_1019_p", "source_sha256": "7b05d3de5f7be05d80c790a06743c56c8cf7892d29c2875e3fae59dd50aa9f79", "ja": "はは、そうか。伊織に任せておけば、\nすごく美味しい店が見つかりそうだな！", "zh": "哈哈，这样啊。交给伊织的话，肯定能找到特别好吃的店！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_02_1020_007ior", "source_sha256": "4522bf35192fa6ef8e4e8f88f4376c90c0b479a099ff6af7f6bfa35b768d55c5", "ja": "ちょっと、私にばっかり、まかせないでよね！\n……それで、春香は何を買ったの？", "zh": "喂，别什么都只交给我啦！\n……对了，春香买了什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_02_1021_001har", "source_sha256": "0e2b30aecf9b881e2574f972b4b0253d25cf9f67db8172ad2bb5e29db30aef36", "ja": "うん。私もいろいろ見てみたんだけど……\n使うものは足りてたから、これにしたんだ♪", "zh": "嗯。我也看了好多东西，不过……\n平时要用的东西都已经够了，所以就买了这件♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_02_1022_032emi", "source_sha256": "88f9591df93a39056a17e925cb5c7f7eb48e0a822b0b0abd06d28c05f29d2339", "ja": "これは……小型の、裁縫道具？", "zh": "这是……小型的针线盒？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_02_1023_022ser", "source_sha256": "02e3ac8c41476ae79e9fedd68c801c18ce1dda39a3f253fbc5a2f6490f06bd01", "ja": "わぁ、かわいいソーイングセットですね！\nでも春香さん、どうしてソーイングセットなんですか？", "zh": "哇，好可爱的针线盒啊！\n不过春香小姐，为什么是针线盒呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_02_1024_001har", "source_sha256": "e91f998c396d51ef2a9e17f47bc19ccd451f0b4d4468453414ab7e783435e092", "ja": "うん。もしも急に衣装のボタンが取れちゃった時とか、\n美咲さんに頼れないなーと思って。", "zh": "嗯。要是衣服上的纽扣突然掉了之类的，也不能总是依赖美咲小姐嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_02_1025_007ior", "source_sha256": "e88ebb7b42a27295ad6407bc73f679e272977e4ed5a6655f2f5e3fd2a87153eb", "ja": "あら、いいじゃない。それじゃ私の衣装がほつれたら、\n春香に直してもらおうかしら？", "zh": "哎呀，不错嘛。那要是我的服装开线了，就让春香帮我缝好吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_02_1026_001har", "source_sha256": "bf3e530668463ac8dd1bc8209152c07d64def0720d04988e1f83be6dc6ddfa55", "ja": "ええっ！？\nそ、そんなすごいのは直せないからね？", "zh": "诶诶！？\n这、这么厉害的活儿我可修不好啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_02_1027_p", "source_sha256": "08ed0694c6367ee270a7917282a5f9b1d60a8a9e1a3b0307f04d0dec126ed1ea", "ja": "買い物は、もう大丈夫そうか？\nあとは公演に向けて、レッスンを始めないとな。", "zh": "买东西的事，已经没问题了吧？接下来得为了公演开始练习了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_02_1028_007ior", "source_sha256": "2d9460b62b745e4103f9cca585fd794a749591077912f1ab23c9537ef2202d9a", "ja": "ええ、そうね！　仙台のみんなにも、伊織ちゃんの\n魅力を見せつけちゃうんだから。にひひっ♪", "zh": "嗯，就是嘛！一定要让仙台的大家也好好见识一下伊织的魅力。嘻嘻♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_02_1029_032emi", "source_sha256": "320781eefaaf7f3f1f035fc79b202e22a65cbbcd99ad55854da775e5e9011e32", "ja": "わ、私もがんばらなくては……仙台のごヒイキ様方に\n恥ずかしいところは見せられません！", "zh": "我、我也必须努力才行……绝不能在仙台的各位贵客面前丢脸！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_02_1030_p", "source_sha256": "439bd469d7864036b501bfb4830f6007549ac0f924231f3540f7f6773e79d9a0", "ja": "（旅の準備は整った。\n明日からは、いよいよレッスン開始だ！）", "zh": "（旅行的准备已经完成了。\n从明天开始，终于要开始训练了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
